      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this CL, we extended the speed feature `gm_erroradv_tr_level` to shorts by adding a conservative intermediate level\u003d1. The existing setting of level\u003d1 for VOD has been as made as level\u003d2. We have verified that this CL produces no noticeable artifacts for the max-drop contents and this change has no impact on VOD test sets.\n\n\nPerformance results of encoder and decoder for the streams generated\nwith low complexity decode enabled.\n\n```\n                      Instruction           Time \n                    Count Reduction(%)    reduction(%)                     BD-Rate Loss(%)\ncpu   Resolution   Encoder    Decoder      Decoder     avg.psnr  ovr.psnr   ssim     vmaf    vmaf_neg  uvq_1p5               \n 1    SHORTS608P    0.095      1.381        0.864       0.0810    0.0785   0.0803   0.0692    0.0873    0.4478       \n 1    SHORTS720P    0.167      1.438        0.797       0.0875    0.0817   0.0817   0.1458    0.1342    0.2234       \n 1   SHORTS1080P    0.263      1.591        0.573       0.0683    0.0641   0.0510   0.0599    0.0576   -0.0161        \n 1       Average    0.175      1.470        0.744       0.0789    0.0748   0.0710   0.0916    0.0930    0.2183       \n                                                                     \n 2    SHORTS608P    0.249      1.344        0.923       0.1013    0.1054   0.1105   0.1786    0.1392    0.1250       \n 2    SHORTS720P    0.290      1.421        0.885       0.0830    0.0877   0.0996   0.1411    0.1115    0.7424       \n 2   SHORTS1080P    0.285      1.497        0.940       0.0644    0.0529   0.0689   0.0755    0.0692   -0.7888         \n 2       Average    0.275      1.421        0.916       0.0829    0.0820   0.0930   0.1317    0.1066    0.0262       \n                                                                     \n 3    SHORTS608P    0.592      1.744        1.120       0.1165    0.1149   0.1520   0.1122    0.1424   -0.1624       \n 3    SHORTS720P    0.528      1.720        1.133       0.1125    0.1123   0.1353   0.1510    0.1524    0.5845       \n 3   SHORTS1080P    0.433      1.745        1.187       0.0523    0.0423   0.0558   0.0710    0.0594   -0.4320             \n 3       Average    0.518      1.736        1.147       0.0938    0.0898   0.1144   0.1114    0.1181   -0.0033\n```\n\n$ perf stat -e instructions:u ./aomenc …\n$ perf stat -e instructions:u ./dav1d --cpumask avx2 …\n\n\nThe decode time is measured using command\ntime taskset -c 0  ./dav1d  --cpumask avx2 …",
